{"a":[18,18],"h":"<p>18.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"111\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 110.5 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 32.5\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21215\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"15.5 24.8 32.5 32.5 44.8 44.8 51.0 62.5 76.9 88.0\" y=\"24.3 24.3 24.3 19.5 24.3 24.3 24.3 24.3 24.3 24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"95.4\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21200\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> - Tefaül babından aslı « <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"66\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 66.0 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 12.8 20.3 20.3 32.5 32.5 50.3 56.5\" y=\"24.3 24.3 24.3 19.5 24.3 24.3 24.3 24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"20.3 38.8\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21215\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » dir. Nafi', İbni kesîr, İbni Âmir kıraetlerinde hanın zammiyle elifsiz «<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"73\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 72.8 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 12.6 20.0 20.0 33.2 33.2 44.8 59.2\" y=\"24.3 24.3 24.3 19.5 24.3 24.3 24.3 24.3\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"20.0\" y=\"24.3\" class=\"Z21215\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » okunur. Ebu Amir ve Ya'kub kıraetlerinde de bu fi'iller hep «ya» ile gaib sıygası üzerine «</p><p><svg class=\"ea\" width=\"312\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 312.0 37.4\"><text x=\"3.0 12.6 20.0 20.0 20.0 26.3 26.3 37.8 37.8 44.0 59.6 70.0 79.6 87.2 87.2 93.2 93.2 103.6 103.6 109.8 115.8 131.6 142.0 151.6 159.0 159.0 172.0 183.7 198.1 208.9 224.8 235.1 244.7 252.1 252.1 258.4 265.1 265.1 276.1 290.5 301.3\" y=\"23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 18.7 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 24.3 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5 23.5\" class=\"Z21205\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text><text x=\"159.0 172.0 258.4\" y=\"23.5\" class=\"Z21215\" font-size=\"18.5\"></text></svg> » okunur. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"159\" height=\"37\" viewBox=\"0 0 158